.DS_Store
.claude/
# …but shared project infra under .claude/ IS tracked (workflows, skills, and the
# asset-schema enforcement hook/settings — these must travel with the repo so every
# agent/machine gets the same guardrails, not just whoever set them up locally).
!.claude/
!.claude/workflows/
!.claude/workflows/**
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
!.claude/settings.json
# personal/local state stays ignored
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/.DS_Store
.vercel

